                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Time Mysteries 2: The Ancient Spectres is a fun little hidden-object adventure. The time-travel theme is probably my favorite part, and I liked seeing how the different locations and periods connected to the story.\r\n\r\nThe puzzles are fairly easy, so don't expect a major challenge, but they are varied enough to keep things entertaining. The artwork also gives the game a nice mysterious atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe story gets a bit complicated, but overall I enjoyed following it.\r\n\r\nEnjoy :)",
